{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>「別被開除，別變得無聊，別死。」</strong>今年3月，在GTC媒體會上，英偉達創始人、CEO黃仁勳曾以開玩笑的方式向記者分享自己人生哲學。黃仁勳還給出了企業版的解釋：<strong>「不要被你的客户拋棄，不要讓公司變得無聊，不要倒閉。」</strong>他希望「儘量在這個三角中保持」，然而幾個月後，這句玩笑話裏的部分內容，成了黃仁勳不得不認真面對的事情。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585758.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.113478+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:46:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"b6605c236b13e838385d16f4f25680580186276f8bd5cdcbe1f69c00349f1923","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}